    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that \"small point of focus\" feels like such a lie. i'm just tired of the constant effort of trying to find meaning in something that objectively doesn't have any. if the end result is just going back to being dust anyway, why bother with the struggle of staying here? it feels like we're all just pretending that our pain matters.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
